\n \n くりびつてんぎょーでしたよ。\n としちゃん。あんたはやっぱり最強だよ。\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J19S7VMSY4R39AMD9ZWF0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 写真は理佐さんと、さとしさんと、\n みぱーんでした(*'-'*)\n 学生証は上村さんとめいめいでした(*'-'*)\n \n こういうランダムのドキドキ感\n だいすきや、、、、\n \n みなさんの真似して、\n 首から写真下げて握手会してみたい☺︎！\n \n \n \n \n \n ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-18356":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間の横浜個別握手会に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった方々！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2014/05/08/3952366/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絢音と双子コーデ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャケット...ダズリン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Tシャツ...GU"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パンツ...アメアパ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バンダナ...古着屋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部色違い、柄違いなの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもジャケットとTシャツは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまたま同じだったから双子コーデ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"をすることに急遽なりました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パンツは私が貸したよ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バンダナは私が赤。絢音が紫。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私=赤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子=黄色"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"純奈=水色"},{"type":"break"},{"typ